  "word_count": 1135,
  "body_markdown": "(310)-481-0111\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4® Dental Implants\n\nHybrid Fixed Detachable Denture\n\nZirconia Fixed Bridge\n\nImplant Supported Dentures\n\nRobotic Surgery\n\nCost & Compare\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nFAQ\n\nAesthetic Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers & Lumineers\n\nInvisalign\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nServices\n\nIV Sedation\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\nTooth Extractions\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPeriodontics\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nMissing Teeth\n\nBone Loss\n\nFailing Dental Implants\n\nLoose Dentures\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nOur Facility\n\nPatient Stories\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\nWho We Are\n\nCommitment To Excellence\n\nMeet Dr. Tony Barriere\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nPatient Portal\n\nNew Patients\n\nCurrent Patients\n\n\n# All-on-4® Dental Implants\n\n\n\n# All-on-4® Full Mouth Dental Implants - Los Angeles, CA\n\n\n\n## Let Us Craft Your Perfect Smile\n\n\n\n### \"Full Arch All-On-4 Gave Me My Confidence Back!\" - Leslie\n\n\nPatient's Story\n\n\n## Completely Renovate Your Look\n\n\nDo you find yourself covering your mouth when you smile? Do you avoid getting your picture taken? Are there certain foods you can’t eat, due to tooth pain and discomfort? We understand. That’s why along with veneers and crowns, we offer All-on-4® full arch implants in Los Angeles, CA! Also known as full mouth dental implants, All-on-4 full arch dental implants are permanent dental replacements for one or both arches of your teeth.\n\nGet Pricing\n\nDr. Barriere Talks About Top 3 Transformative Cosmetic Dental Procedures\n\n\n## Consider Your Options\n\n\nAt West LA Implants, we offer top-tier dental care, especially when it comes to implants. Even if other dentists have declined to perform dental implant surgery on you, Dr. Barriere at West LA Implants offers free second opinions, and he specializes in difficult cases. Find out if you’re a candidate for dental implant surgery today! We provide an assortment of choices – including traditional dentures, implant supported dentures, and All-on-4 permanent full mouth dental implants – for you, based on your needs.\n\nIf your current dental implants are failing or causing you pain, we can restore them with dental implant restorations. This procedure can enable you to live without mouth pain once again, but it requires a delicate touch and years of experience, which Dr. Barriere offers. A good compromise for people who want the stability and strength of dental implants, but aren’t able to commit to full mouth dental replacement, implant supported dentures — available in both full and partial — attach to posts that are implanted in your mouth. Compared to traditional dentures, they provide improved biting and chewing power and reduced friction. All-on-4 Dental Implants are ideal for people who are missing many teeth, as they replace all of your teeth at once. They permanently attach to your jaw, and you take care of them like you would your natural teeth.\n\n\n#### Traditional Dentures\n\n\nRemovable\n\nLast 5+ years\n\nMay require adhesives\n\nAllow bone recession\n\nLimit food choices\n\n\n#### Implant Supported Dentures\n\n\nRemovable or fixed\n\nLast 10+ years\n\nSecured by 2+ implants\n\nLimit bone recession\n\nExpand food choices\n\n\n#### Full Mouth Dental Implants\n\n\nFixed for lasting support\n\nLast decades to a lifetime\n\nSecured by 4+ implants\n\nPrevent bone recession\n\nNo dietary limitations\n\nDr. Barriere Talks About Why Does Dental Implant Treatment Experience Matter?\n\n\n## The West LA Implants Process\n\n\n\n#### Step 1: Your Initial Visit\n\n\nWhen you first visit our office, you’ll find a whole team of experts who are ready to help you find out whether dental implants are the right option for you. At your initial consultation, we’ll take a three-dimensional cone-beam computed tomography (CBCT) scan of your mouth and jaw. This helps us determine the ideal placement for implants, and we can also diagnose any issues that need to be treated before you receive them. From these scans, Dr. Barriere will create custom chrome surgical guides that enable the precision placement of your dental implants. These guides ensure that your posts are implanted onto the strongest part of your jaw, maximizing your chances of success.\n\n\n#### Step 2: The Day of Surgery\n\n\nYour next appointment will be your dental implant surgery. We offer oral, IV and nitrous oxide sedation for implant surgery, so your time in the chair will seem to pass in the blink of an eye. During your procedure, Dr. Barriere will remove any remaining teeth, then use guides to precisely implant four or more titanium or zirconia posts into specially chosen areas of your jawbone. During the next several months, these posts will fuse with your jaw in a process called osseointegration. Thanks to our TeethToday® technology, you’ll come away from surgery with temporary nanoceramic replacement teeth, then three to four months later, you’ll return for your final zirconia restorations.\n\n\n#### Step 3: Final Steps\n\n\nAfter three or more months, your posts will have sufficiently fused with your jawbone to support your restoration. When you return to our office, we’ll make sure your jaw is in good shape and we’ll place your final restoration, checking to make sure it fits well and feels good.\n\nView More Results\n\nAll-On-4 Dental Implants\n\n\n## Your Ideal Smile is Absolutely Achievable\n\n\nYou owe it to yourself to rejuvenate your smile with All-on-4 dental implants in Los Angeles, CA. They will not only give you a new and dazzling smile, they will allow you to enjoy the foods you have been denying yourself for too long, like steak, nuts and raw vegetables. On top of all those benefits, your implants will actually improve the health of your jawbone.\n\nIt’s one of the best investments in your health and happiness you can make, and we don’t want financial roadblocks to keep you from enjoying it. If your insurance doesn’t cover our solutions, that’s not the end of the conversation. We are partnered with third-party financing companies, and we can find a monthly payment solution that will fit your budget. Come in to find out how your new smile and greater joy are more obtainable than you think!\n\n\n## Our Patients tell the story best\n\n\n\n##### \"I Felt Like The Old Me Because Of My Crowns & Dental Implants\"\n\n\n\n##### Emily - Crowns & Dental Implants\n\n\n\n##### \"I Have Teeth Again Thanks To My Full Mouth Reconstruction!\"\n\n\n\n##### Michael - Full Mouth Reconstruction\n\n\n\n## Schedule An Appointment\n\n\nDesired Consult Date\n\nPreferred Method of Communication\n\nText\n\nPhone\n\nEmail\n\nSend\n\nI understand the information disclosed in this form may be subject to re-disclosure and may no longer be protected by HIPAA privacy regulations and the HITECH Act.\n\n\n### Find out if you're a\n\n\n\n## candidate for dental implants\n\n\n\n#### Answer the Following Questions To Learn more about our pricing and financing options.\n\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Yelp Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddress:\n\n12301 Wilshire Blvd Suite 205,\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 481-0111\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDental Website by Progressive Dental Marketing",
